# Local Claude Code state
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/.cc-writes/

# Machine-local shell config. These two ARE tracked (committed once as empty
# skeletons) and bootstrap.sh marks them skip-worktree, which is what actually
# keeps your edits out of git. Listing them here is a guard for the case where
# they ever become untracked -- a tracked file ignores .gitignore entirely.
shell/local.sh
shell/local.zsh
